{"hw":"τροφεύς","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">τροφεύς</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">τροφ-εύς</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">έως</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one who brings up, foster-father,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">344</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">El.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">45</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theophil.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">tutor,</b> <span class=\"gk\">βασιλέως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OGI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">148.2</span> </span> (Cyprus, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii B. C.</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">256.1</span> </span> (Delos, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii B. C.</span>), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sammelb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1568.1</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii B. C.)</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.664</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">M.Ant.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.31</span> </span>; of a woman, <b class=\"lex-tr\">nurse,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">760</span> </span> (<span class=\"gk\">στροφεύς</span> codd.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">863</span> </span>, Ajax addresses the plains and fountains of Troy, <span class=\"gk\">χαίρετ' ὦ τροφῆς ἐμοί</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">ye who have fed</b> me, or <b class=\"lex-tr\">with whom</b> I <b class=\"lex-tr\">have lived</b>; so <span class=\"gk\">τροφέας παρέδωκε τὴν γῆν καὶ τὴν θάλασσαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.1.2</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">rearer, breeder,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἵππων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">735b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἅρματος τ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one who keeps</b> a chariot, ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">834b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πάσης κακίας</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one who fosters</b> all wickedness, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">580a</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">4</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one who gives free meals to the people,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">IGRom.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.89</span> </span> (Amastris, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">i A. D.</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.1680</span> </span> (Pergam.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">5</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">personal attendant, slave,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristid.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">49(25).3</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">50(26).103</span> </span>.</div></div>"}